            <ArticleTitle>[Nurses' role in cases of total pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>36-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Health professional daily confront the pain and suffering persons who need our help undergo. From a nurse's methodology this article describes a new perspective about nurses' role regarding total pain, employing as a tool to deal with this topic the AREA holistic pain model, a model which centers on the person and his/her family permanently seeking results derived from a plan which joins together all treatments and based on the creation of a reasoning network that will provide prioritized nursing diagnoses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
